配图词（oo 族）：woods, foot, book, cook

## F. Let's Read
On a sunny day, Kaikai wants to make a kite.
"Can I borrow your pencil, please?" he asks Lulu.
"Sure. Here you are."
"Can I use your brushes, Jiajia?" Jiajia gives him the brushes.
"I think you need some glue," Xiaoxiao says. Xiaoxiao passes the glue to Kaikai.
"Thank you all. Let's make the kite together." Kaikai is happy.
They work together and help each other.
"Your kite is beautiful!" Xiaoxiao says.
"It's our kite," Kaikai says.
They laugh and they are happy today.

练习：Read and number.（6 幅图排序）

